ctionDate xsd:date, and cargoTankCarriesOil xsd:boolean) so malformed values cannot make the conditional query fail to match and accidentally bypass the requirement. Preserve the prior instruction to omit unconditional minCount constraints unless independently required and to validate every cargoTankOuterShellSeparation value independently for QuantityValue type, decimal qudt:numericValue, metre unit, and numericValue >= 0.76.","blocking":false,"semantic_attempt_consumed":false}
